/* brez-obrob */ .wswebshot__av,.wswebshot__k,.wswebshot__media,.wswebshot__pog>div,.wswebshot__polna,.wswebshot__red4:not(.wswebshot__pog)>div,.wswebshot__tk,span.wswebshot__pi{border:0!important}
</style>
<script>
(function(){document.querySelectorAll('.wswebshot__kar').forEach(function(k){
  var w=document.createElement('div');w.className='wswebshot__karw';k.parentNode.insertBefore(w,k);w.appendChild(k);
  ['l','d'].forEach(function(s){var b=document.createElement('button');b.type='button';b.className='wswebshot__pus wswebshot__pus--'+s;b.setAttribute('aria-label',s==='l'?'Prethodno':'Sljedeće');b.innerHTML=s==='l'?'&#8249;':'&#8250;';
    b.addEventListener('click',function(){var x=k.firstElementChild;var d=x?x.getBoundingClientRect().width+22:300;k.scrollBy({left:s==='l'?-d:d,behavior:'smooth'});});w.appendChild(b);});
});})();
</script>
